                    10/15–21/79. Secret. Carter initialed the memorandum and wrote: “Warren.”</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d218-f2" n="2" xml:id="d218-f2-content">
                <p>See Edward J. Derwinski, “Panama: From No to Yes,” <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Washington Post</hi>, April 18, 1979, p. A25.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d218-f3" n="3" xml:id="d218-f3-content">
                <p> Carter wrote in the left margin: “He should go to Panama.”</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
